<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja pili jaka Pauli kwaka Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Timo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua pili jaka Pauli kwaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ja pili kwaka Timoti ndi balua ja pili kuandikwa na Pauli kunzende mmbolee waki Timoti. Balua ja pili kwaka Timoti jaandiki Pauli pajwahegali kuhiki mwisu wa womi waki. Kipindi se hesi jwabi ku kipungu ku Loma, mu lipungu 1:16. Pauli jwabi nu ukosi na Timoti na muda wingi ankema ngati mwana waki, mu lipungu la Pilimini 2:22, 1 Timoti 1:2, 1:18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua jenze ndi kati ja balua nsesi yaka Pauli yeanhandaki mundu jumujumu na ngase ju liandaki likundi la bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu. Balua yengi itatu ngati balua ju utumbuli kwaka Timoti na balua kwaka Titu na balua kwaka Pilimini. Kipindi balua ja pili kwaka Timoti pa jabia jitenda kuandikwa Bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu babii mu ubambu ukolongu uku Loma babia atenda kung'alika. Kuwesikana jeniejije ndi jabia ndaba jaka Pauli kubekwa mu ligelesa na ndi anhandakia Timoti kumpwagi juhinakalia mang'aliku. Ngati he kwabia mu kitabu su utumbuli kwaka Timoti, Pauli ankanakia majambu gingi ga mabole gi isoli, mu lipungu 1 Timoti 1:16-18. Ampwagila kabee Timoti kupwaga kwiikuba ni kipindi su kung'alika kulongi jabu, mu lipungu la 3:1</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli jutumbuli balua jaki su kunndamuki Timoti, mu lipungu la 1:1-2. Nukumpwagi majambu gajupalika kupwaga, mu lipungu la 1:3-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndi ampwagi Timoti mang'aliku gagiipitila nu kumpwagi juhinakalia, mu lipungu la 2:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndienu ampeke mabole goti nukamu, mu lipungu 2:14-26.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee anndakali kuhenga majambu gilia gagahika nu kumpeke indela jejipalika kuhenga, mu lipungu la 3:1-4; 8.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli jujomule su kumpeke malagalaki gaki mweni Timoti, mu lipungu la 4:9-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Nepani Pauli, jojuwe Sapanga japala nguba ntumi waka Yesu Kilisitu ili nandila womi gojutulagi mu kuhangangana na Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Nuguhandaki wehapa wamwanangu jonugupai wa Timoti. Nukulobe waamboni waka Sapanga nu lukwali kuhuma kwa Atati bitu Yesu Kilisitu Bambu witu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusengu na malobi gukugangamalisa mwoju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Nunsengu Sapanga jonuntumaki kwa moju sapi ngati ebahenga aseja bitu, nunsengu kila pangomboka mu kuloba kwangu ikilu na muhi. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Ngomboka maholi gaku na ndogule ngamaa kugubona, ili dwelakiya ndogule. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Nukukomboka kuhobale kwaku kwa sakaka, kuhobale kojubii naku mbuja waku Loisi, na kabee, amabu baku Euniki. Manya wehapa kabee gubi naku. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Ndi ndaba nugukombuke nhendaliya kukihenge lihengu sapi nhupi jejugupeki Sapanga kipindi panugubekila maboku gangu panani jaku. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Ndaba Sapanga ngasejutupekia Loho juku kuhola ila loho ja makili ju upali na mwoju ukulilongosa.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Ndienu, wiibona iyoni kupwaga gawagabweni nu kujoana kupete Bambu witu, wala wiibona iyona ndaba jangu jojubii mpungwa ndaba jaki. Lakini guhangangana mu mang'aliku ndaba ji Lijambu la Amboni, kulengana makili gagujupeki Sapanga. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Jombi jutuokua nukutukema ili tutama maisa ga sapi, nga ndaba jukupalika kwa mahengu gitu, ila ndaba ja waamboni waki. Jutupeki uamboni waka Sapanga we hogu ndaba jaka Kilisitu Yesu kabula ji kipindi, <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>lakini kuyekuliwi kwitu henu kukuhika kwaki nkombosi witu, Yesu Kilisitu. Jombi jukomiki makili ga kuwa, ni kwi indela ji Lijambu la Amboni jalangia womi wanga na kuwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Nepani anhagwi mia nu ntumi na mmbola ndaba jukulandi Lijambu la Amboni, <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>nane ng'alika kwa majambu ganga ndaba heji. Lakini mii na malangu gango ndaba nummanyi jola, jonunhobale, kabee manya jombi jakilonda sapi sindu sejumbeki, mpaka lisoba lela. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Kamula nganganganga mabole ga Sakaka ganuguboliki nukuhigali mu kuhobale nu upali gogubii mu kujongana na Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Lijambu la amboni lela lebugupekiya ulilonda kwa makili ga Loho gaka Sapanga jojutama nkati jitu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Ngati egumanyiki, bandu boti nkoa uku Asia aneili, kati jabu koni naka Fugeli na Helumogene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Bambu jaabonila ikia aka kilongu baka Onesipoli, ndaba jandogule mmwoju mala jingi, wala ngasejabona iyoni ndaba nabii mukipungu, <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>ila ejahika pe ku Loma, jatumbuliya kundaputa ngamaa mpaka pajamona. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Bambu anzangatiya kupata ikia jaka Sapanga mu lisoba lela! Nawehapa gumanyiki sapi gingi gajahengila ku Epesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Nndonda jojuhobaleka waka Yesu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Ndienu, wehapa wamwanangu, gubiya na makili mu uamboni waka Sapanga gotupata mu kujongana na Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Jukua mabole gala gawaanyoa nakatangasa palongi jinu na bandu babagabona nu kugajoa bingi, ugakabisa kwa bandu bahobaleka, babii nu uwesu kabola bangi.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Hangangana mang'aliku pamu na nepani ngati alonda bahobaleka baka Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Alonda mungondu ajepana ni lihengu la masoba gahenu, ili juwesa kumpendesa nkolongu wa alonda. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Jojujombateka imbelu jokapi nga kuwesa nukupata nhupi jukuwesa ngati ananga jakapwatalii malagalaki gu kujombateka hoku. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Nndemi jojuwe juhengiki lihengu likolongu kupata pandu pu uwanzu ukuhusa. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Holaliya ganiaga gambwagiki, ndaba Bambu jaguwesisa guelelawa kila sindu.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Gunkombuka Yesu Kilisitu jojuyokiki kuhuma bandu baawii, jojabii mu kibeleku saka Daudi, ngati elipwagiki Lijambu la Amboni lenandi, <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>na jejuje ndaba jaki nepani ng'aliki na angongiki minyolu ngati nehalabana. Lakini lilobi laka Sapanga ngaseliwesi kukogwa minyolu. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Ndaba nhinakali kila sindu ndaba ja bandu bahaguliwi na Sapanga, ili bombi kabee apata ukombosi gogupatikana kwi indela jaka Yesu Kilisitu, na goguwe guleta ukolongu wa yaka petapeta. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Upwagi gongo ndi wasakaka:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">“Ana twakuiki pamu najombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">twitama kabee pamu najombi.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Ana tuhendali kunhinakali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">twilongua kabee pamu najombi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Ana tukaniki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">najombi kabee jwiitenda kutukana.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Anatukosiki kuba totuhobaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">jombi jihigaliya kuba jojuhobaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">ndaba jombi ngakuwesa kulikana mweni.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jojuhenga lihengu jojujetakiwa na Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Ndienu, akombukiya bandu baku majambu haga na kukana palongi gaka Sapanga aleka ing'omu panani ja malobi. Ing'omu we hogu ngasegupalika, ila guleta kuhalabana nkolongu kwa bala babugujoa. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Kasana kulilangi gujetakiwi palongi jaka Sapanga ngati jojuhenga lihengu jojuwe ngasejubona iyoni kupete lihengu laki na jojuwe jupundisa sapi malobi ga sakaka gaka Sapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Jepana na malobi giliya ni giking'ang'a ganga kuhuma kwa Sapanga, ndaba haga gajonzukee bandu kwaabeka kutali na Sapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Mabole ge haga ngati kilonda selikula nhyega. Kati ja bandu be haba baboliki haga ni Himenayo na Pileto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Haba ajilei indela ja sakaka, nu kuhalabana kuhobale kwa bandu bangi sukupwaga kuyoka kwitu guhengiki. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Lakini nsingi gojusengiki Sapanga gubii nganganganga, na panani jaki ahandiki malobi haga: “Bambu jaamanyiki bala baabii baki,” na “Kila jojupwaga jombi ndi Bambu, ndi kupalika julekana nu ubaja.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Mnyumba ngolongu ibii yombu hingi na indu ya kila namuna: Yengi alenganaki na madini ya zahabu na madini ga feza, yengi yi imbau nu yu utopi, yengi ya matumisi gi hisima na yengi ya matumisi gaka kawaida. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Ndienu, ana mundu jalinyambisa sukulibeka kutali na yombu yoti yanga ni isima, jibiya sombu sa matumisi ga kajika, ndaba atei kunhagu ndaba ji lihengu laka Sapanga na ampala Bambu na jubii tayali kila lihengu la amboni. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Jepana na ndokule iliya yu ukombu, gukasana kuhenga majambu gagajetakewa na Sapanga nu kuhobale nu upali nu lukwali pamu na bandu boti babube andoba Bambu kwa mwoju wa sapi. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Kotuka ubisi uking'ang'a nu king'ang'a, gumanyiki haga galeta milomu. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Ntumi waka Bambu jiikuba ni milomu. Jupalika kuba mpoli kwa bandu boti, mmbola jwa amboni nu jukuhinakali, <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>jupalika kuba mpoli pajalakali abaja baki, ndaba pangi Sapanga jaapekiya mbekenyu jukujetake na kugaleka mahakau, nukugumanya usakaka. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Papuje mawasu gabu gaakelubukiya kabee, biikwelapuka muntegu wii Lijobi jojajonziki na kahenga bagajetakiya gajupala jombi.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Masoba ga mwisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Kombuka ana, mu masoba ga mwisu kwiibiya ni kipindi sa mang'aliku. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Bandu biibiya babilipala beni na baapala lupija, babililumbali, baabii ni ing'omu, na babuntondo Sapanga, banga kwaajoane atati na amabu na banga kunsengu na banga ba sapi, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>banga nu upali, banga ni ikia na bini isoli na banga kuwesa kulilongosa beni na bandu akali na banga kupala majambu ga amboni, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>biibiya bandu babaang'anambuka ajabu na baabi ni ing'omu na jwanga kunzogopa Sapanga baatweli kukipuna na bapala hindu yu pundema pani ngani kuliku kumpala Sapanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Sakunza biiponikana ngati bandu babumpai Sapanga, lakini bagakana makili gaki. Jepana nakanopi na bandu ba namuna heji. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Bangi babu ajenda mu manyumba ga bandu na kwaakamu akabomba ang'ang'a baakamulikiwi ni misigu ja mahakau na baalongoswa na ndokule ya kila aina. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Akammbomba haba alenga kila lisoba kulibola lakini ngaseawesa kuiki umanyi wasakaka we hogu. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Bandu be haba agupenga usakaka ngati Yane na Yambule ebumpenga Musa. Haba ndi bandu bana malangu gagahobiki na baahobale kwiisoli. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Lakini ngabiwesi kuendalee ngani ndaba ung'ang'a wabu wibonikana pangwendu kwa boa. Ndi ekwikuba kwaka Yane na Yabule.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagisu ga mwisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Lakini wehapa wagapwatiki mabole gangu na hembalika kuba nu kupala kwangu mu maisha gangu. Kabee wapwatiki kuhobale kwangu nu kuhinakali kwangu nu upali wangu nu kulendale kwangu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>mang'aliku na tabu. Wagamanyi majambu gagambatiki ku Antiokia nu ku Ikonia nu Lusitila. Nahinakali tabu ngolongu ngamaa! Lakini Bambu jaokua mu majambu haga goa. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Kila mundu jojupala kutama maisa gu kunndumbali Sapanga mukujongana ni kilisitu Yesu kupalika kung'alika. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Bandu biliya na baalonge isoli na biiendaliya kuba biliya, baakonga bangi na bombi beni biitenda kukongwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Lakini wehapa uhigaliya mu usakaka agolagola gobukubola nu kuuhobale ngamaa. Waamanyi bandu bababi aka abola baku, <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>na gukomboka tumbuka umwana waku, uliboliki Maandiku gaka Sapanga gaguge gawesa kugupeke umanyi gogukulongosa mu uokovu kwi indela jukunhobale Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Maandiku goa ga sapi gaka Sapanga gaandikwi ku ulongosi waka Sapanga, na gapaliki kubola usakaka nu kulakali kulenganake makosa nukwaalongosa bandu atama maisa gajupala Sapanga, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>ili mundu waka Sapanga jubiya jojutosani, na juwesa kuhenga mahengu goti gaamboni.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Nugulagalaki palongi jaka Sapanga na palongi jaka Kilisitu Yesu jojaatemula bandu babii bomi na bakuwiki, na ndaba juhika kundongosa koni jubi Bambu Nkolongu: <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Gulandila malobi gaka Sapanga ganga, gubia tayali kipindi sekipalika ni kipindi sanga kupalika, lakalia kanakiya nukugangamalisa mioju baahinakali na kwaabola sukuhinakali kwoti. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Ndaba kihika kipindi sesuse bandu ngabijoane mabole gaki ga sakaka, ila biipwata ndokule yabu beni nu kulibonge aka abola bingi babapwagila majambu gagabi tayali kujowana kwa makutu gabu pee. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Biikana kujoana usakaka bajing'anambukiya luhomu lwiisoli. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Lakini wehapa, gubiya mihu mu kila hali na inakalia mang'aliku na henga lihengu la mundu jojulandi Lijambu la Amboni, jomuliya utumi waku woti.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Ku upandi wangu nepani, mii pambipi ngani kumbia litambiku lelisembaleka ni kipindi sa kuwa kwangu kihikike. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Ngasini ngamaa mu kusindana, nyomulii sapwali joti nukuhobale kwangu nukutunziki. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Nahenu, niihigali pena kupata nhupi jukuwesa kutama ngati hejupala Sapanga, seketule jaka Bambu, Jojutemu ngati ejupala Sapanga, jiimbekiya nepani lisoba lela, na wala nga nepani pena, ila bandu boti balingalii su upali kuhuma kwaki.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagisu gaka Pauli kwaka Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Kasana kuhika kwangu nnyata. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Ndaba Dema, jugupai nndema gongo janeka nukujenda ku Tesaloniki. Kilesike jupiti ku Galatia na Titu jupiti ku Dalumatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luka kajika jaki ndi jojubii pamba pamu na nepani. Ntaputa Maluko guhika naku, ndaba jwiiwesa kunyangati mu lihengu langu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Nuntuma Tukiko ku Epesu. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Pawihika winetila kaputi jangu lenileka kwaka Kupulo ku Tiloa, netila kabee itabu hasa ya ngosi yela.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Pundi jojulenganake hindu ya yoma jobunkema Alekizanda jundendi ubaja wingi; Bambu andepa kulengana na mahengu gaki haga. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Nzepana naku ndaba jugupenga malobi gitu su ukali.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Kipindi panalikengaliya kwa mala ja kwanza nga mundu jojwajema upandi wangu na boa batenda kuneka. Sapanga jukotuka kwaabalangi likosa le heli! <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Lakini Bambu jwabii pamu nane, jambekiya makili na hata nawesa kulandi malobi gaka Sapanga, bandu banga Ayaudi bagajowana, kabee naokuliwa mu kutemuliwa kuwa ngati nndomu wi lihimba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Bambu junhoko na majambu goti giliya, na kunyuku sapi mbaka mu ukolongu waki ukunani kwaka Sapanga. Kwaki gubiya ulumbi yaka petapeta na petapeta! Amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malamuki gukujomulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Alamukiya Pisikila na Akula, pamu na bandu ba nyumba jaka Onesipoli. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elasito jahigaliya ku Kolintu, najombi Tilofimo nundeka ku Miletu ndaba jabiya nngonzu. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Henga kanyata kuhika kabula jiki kipindi sikipepu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ebulu na Pudensi na Linusi na Kalaudia atenda kugulamuki, ahelahe aka kilongu bangi boti.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Bambu jubiya pamu na wehapa mu loho jaku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Nunndobe uamboni waka Sapanga mwabote.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
